          "id": "body",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Walls and palaces, rock-solid, are seen with different eyes — seeing has a history on the observer's side. Then the body remembered through its acts: the lip that found healing in a kiss, the foot that tested the cliff, the hand once gentle in doing good — all changed. The name remains, its bearer altered: what calls itself by it arrived like a wave, hurrying toward the element.",
