          "kicker": "#4 · lines 33–40; the verified German closing words",
          "title": "Beginning and end joined; content and form",
          "italic": "The lyric demonstrates its own answer: the poem has carried blossom, valley, swimmer, changing eyes and the named wave into one formed sequence — the opening wish returns changed by the poem that answered it.",
